      "_comment": "Level 1. QCF x2 + LP, one bar. A fireball ender: cheap, the lowest damage of the three, and the thing a cancelable normal is actually converting into. The double quarter-circle contains a single one, so the same input throws an ordinary fireball when the bar is not there — the meter is checked when the move is selected, not after it comes out. Like the fireball it is the projectile that hits; the move itself has no hitbox.",
