    {
      "_comment": "The throw. LP and LK on the same frame, which is what makes it a decision rather than a button: press LP first and the jab comes out, and the throw is lost. Unblockable — that is the point of it, since blocking beats every strike in the game — but refused against anyone airborne or in stun, and escapable by pressing throw inside the tech window. It reaches a shade further than 5LP, so at jab range the defender is genuinely choosing between blocking and teching, and 23 frames of recovery is what guessing wrong costs the thrower.",
